+# A2 bounded prototype reproduction
+
+Historical evidence source only; this patch is not authorization to build, fit,
+submit jobs, repeat the panel or change a default. Apply it to the exact base
+e975bf3ddda7746dc62e0ee9d641cd07d1c0a684 in an isolated checkout. The runtime
+source is the final reviewed prototype; no production qualification follows.
+Apply using git apply --unidiff-zero --whitespace=error: the runtime hunks use
+zero context so this retained patch also passes repository whitespace checks.
+
+The tests embedded in the runtime patch reproduce the sixteen focused witnesses.
+The near-roundoff JSON describes all512 dyadic rows without storing observations,
+the independent contrasts, the failure and repair. To inspect the failed variant,
+decode failed-near-roundoff-variant.json with unpack_failed_variant.py, which
+checks exact bytes and SHA256, then apply the output patch to a separate pristine
+base. The JSON encoding preserves the original patch without nested whitespace
+notices. Never layer the failed variant on the repaired source. No scientific tolerance is weakened.
+
+Tools here preserve the executed driver logic. SCC/build wrapper installation
+paths are replaced by FEREG_STUDY_ROOT, CARGO_HOME and RUSTUP_HOME. The local test
+runner accepts FEREG_RUST_BIN; driver guards accept FEREG_SOURCE_ROOT. Header-only
+dictionaries and public compact matrices replace external guard fixture payloads.
+Original and portable-copy hashes are retained separately in the evidence record.
+
+For an independently authorized reproduction, first copy these tools into a new
+scratch root and arrange the patched checkout as a2-source. Retain failed attempts
+and keep the predeclared finite budget. Historical wrapper job IDs, plugin hashes,
+accounting and manifest bindings must be replaced by newly reviewed identities;
+do not submit these historical wrappers unchanged. The standard Linux build
+retains generic x86 defaults and runtime FMA selection. Candidate fits require a
+separately reviewed driver and explicit budget. Frozen campaign observations must
+be reconstructed from their original archives and complete hashes, never generated.
+
+The retained record contains the full scopes, public result bits and structured
+traces needed to inspect every attempted or unattempted cell. No raw log, private
+installation path, replay observation bank or generated campaign dataset is kept.
